{"id":"22-1301-2-61","zh":"pitaro，pitare，pitarā，pitunā，pitarehi，pitarebhi，pitūhi，pitūbhi，pitu，pitussa，pituno，pitūnaṃ，pitarānaṃ，pitarā，pitunā，pitarehi，pitarebhi，pitūhi，pitūbhi，pitu，pitussa，pituno，pitūnaṃ，pitarānaṃ，pitānaṃ，pitusmiṃ，pitumhi，pitari，pitaresu，pitūsu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-1302-2-37","zh":"“anaṇo ñātinaṃ hoti，devānaṃ pitunañca so”（他对亲族不负债，对天神和父辈也不负债）〔jā.2.22.126〕；“mātāpitūnaṃ accayena”（父母去世以后）；“dhammaṃ cara mahārāja，mātāpitūsu khattiya”（大王啊，刹帝利啊，要对父母奉行正法）〔jā.2.17.39〕。","confidence":75}
