{"id":"22-1304-2-4","zh":"为什么说“除 nattu 等以外”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-1304-5-15","zh":"因为有 nattā，nattāro，nattāraṃ，nattāro，nattāre 等形式。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-1304-16-18","zh":"panattu 一词也是如此。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-1305-2-46","zh":"而 mātu、dhītu、duhitu 这几个词只用于阴性：mātā，mātaro，bhoti māta，bhoti mātā，或者 bhoti māte；也可以见到“acchariyaṃ nandamāte，abbhutaṃ nandamāte”（难陀之母啊，真是稀有！难陀之母啊，真是前所未有！）〔a.ni.7.53〕这样的用例。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-1305-47-53","zh":"依‘Ghabrahmāditve’规则，ga（呼格单数词尾）变为 e。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-1305-54-82","zh":"bhotiyo mātaro，mātaraṃ，mātuṃ，mātaro，mātare，mātuyā，mātarā，mātarehi，mātarebhi，mātūhi，mātūbhi，mātu，mātussa，mātuyā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-1305-83-105","zh":"在论典中可以见到“mātussa sarati，pitussa saratī”（忆念母亲，忆念父亲）〔rū.169；nī.160页〕这样的用例。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-1305-106-129","zh":"也可以见到“buddhamātussa sakkāraṃ，karotu sugatoraso”（愿善逝的亲生子向佛母致敬）〔apa.therī.2.2.259〕这样的用例。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-1305-130-135","zh":"mātūnaṃ，mātānaṃ，mātarānaṃ。","confidence":90}
